                <section id="products" class="luma-section luma-collections"><div class="container"><div class="luma-section-heading"><div><p class="luma-eyebrow">Find your feeling</p><h2>Rooms with a point of view.</h2></div><a href="/shop" class="luma-text-link">View all pieces <span>&#8594;</span></a></div><div class="luma-collection-grid"><a href="/shop" class="luma-collection luma-collection-1"><span>01</span><h3>The living room</h3><small>Soft landing spots</small></a><a href="/shop" class="luma-collection luma-collection-2"><span>02</span><h3>The dining room</h3><small>Gather around</small></a><a href="/shop" class="luma-collection luma-collection-3"><span>03</span><h3>The bedroom</h3><small>Slow mornings</small></a></div></div></section>
                <section id="about" class="luma-section luma-story"><div class="container luma-story-grid"><div class="luma-story-art"><div class="luma-chair"></div><div class="luma-floor-lamp"></div></div><div class="luma-story-copy"><p class="luma-eyebrow">About Luma Home</p><h2>Good design should feel like home.</h2><p>We believe furniture can be beautiful without being precious. Every Luma piece balances considered design with the comfort, durability, and flexibility of daily life.</p><p>From the first sketch to delivery day, we make the process personal and clear.</p><a href="/contactus" class="btn luma-btn luma-btn-outline">Start a project <span>&#8599;</span></a></div></div></section>
