    <template id="furniture_services" name="Furniture Services">
        <t t-call="website.layout">
            <t t-set="title">Services | Luma Home</t>
            <main id="wrap" class="luma-inner-page luma-services-page">
                <section class="luma-inner-hero"><div class="container"><p class="luma-eyebrow">More than furniture</p><h1>A room that<br/><em>works for you.</em></h1><p>From the first moodboard to the final installation, our team makes creating a beautiful space feel simple.</p></div></section>
                <section class="luma-inner-section"><div class="container"><div class="luma-page-intro"><p class="luma-eyebrow">How we help</p><h2>Thoughtful support,<br/>at every scale.</h2></div><div class="luma-service-list"><article><span>01</span><div><h3>Interior direction</h3><p>Bring us your room, your references, or just a feeling. We will help shape a clear direction for colors, materials, layout, and furniture.</p></div><a href="/contactus">Learn more &#8599;</a></article><article><span>02</span><div><h3>Custom furniture</h3><p>Need a different size, finish, or configuration? We work with you to create pieces that fit your home and your everyday rituals.</p></div><a href="/contactus">Start a request &#8599;</a></article><article><span>03</span><div><h3>Project furnishing</h3><p>For offices, restaurants, hotels, and full homes, we coordinate selections, quantities, timelines, and delivery in one place.</p></div><a href="/contactus">Plan a project &#8599;</a></article><article><span>04</span><div><h3>Delivery &amp; installation</h3><p>We bring every piece in carefully, place it where it belongs, and make sure your room is ready to enjoy.</p></div><a href="/contactus">Ask a question &#8599;</a></article></div></div></section>
